The operations request can't be included. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` would need filesystem access, and the target has no WASI adapter. Fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would need `aap:caps/http-client`. Neither is in the node's authority. Sending the item's text to that service would also move untrusted feed content to an outside endpoint, which the graph doesn't allow. If operations needs input logs or enrichment, those belong in the graph as separate nodes, each granted its own `Notifier`/`StateHandle` or `HTTPClient<[metadata.internal.example]>` capability. The files below implement only the contracted node.

